@* What a page is, in a search engine's own words (F123): a schema.org record written as JSON-LD into the page's head,
   where the browser keeps it and the framework's prerenderer carries it into the HTML a crawler reads. The script is
   written whole as markup, since a component may not hold a script tag of its own. *@
<HeadContent>@((MarkupString)Script)</HeadContent>
